<title>GREECE: XIOSBANK RAISES DEPOSIT RATE BY 25 BPS.</title>
<headline>XIOSBANK RAISES DEPOSIT RATE BY 25 BPS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xiosbank said on Monday it is raising its Xios-Alma deposit rate by 25 basis points to 9.5 percent taking the view that interest rates will stay slightly firmer in the short term.</p>
<p>Likewise, its base business lending rate is raised 50 basis points to 17.5 percent. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
